[2.265, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;35m═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;35m  \u001b[1mThe seven graphical tools an agent drives: registry, tenant scope, hijack lease, and every refusal in between\u001b[0m\u001b[1;35m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;35m═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.062, "o", "\u001b[1;36m  → 1. A target is a registry entry, not a connection string.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.027, "o", "\u001b[1;32m  ✓ POST /api/graphical-targets → 201\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    \u001b[2mserver-assigned id:\u001b[0m \u001b[1mgt-73182690a4e9 (memory) 800x600\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    \u001b[2msecrets in response:\u001b[0m \u001b[1mnone\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m  → 2. The scope comes from the principal. A body cannot claim one.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[1;33m  ! POST /api/graphical-targets (tenant_id in body) → 422 {'code': 'tenant_managed', 'message': 'tenant_id is assigned from authenticated identity'}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;36m  → 3. Injection is charged against a hijack lease.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "\u001b[1;32m  ✓ PATCH /api/sessions/provide-shell (input_mode=hijack) → 200\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.505, "o", "\u001b[1;32m  ✓ POST /worker/provide-shell/hijack/acquire → 200\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mlease:\u001b[0m \u001b[1m78768aa4-7a57-4fc2-9c06-acaa2a5066d0\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[1;32m  ✓ POST /worker/provide-shell/gui/attach → 200\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;36m  → 4. The seven tools, in the order an agent uses them.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.005, "o", "\u001b[1;32m  ✓ gui_screenshot → 200\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[1;32m  ✓ gui_click → 200\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[1;32m  ✓ gui_type → 200\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[1;32m  ✓ gui_key → 200\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "\u001b[1;32m  ✓ gui_drag → 200\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "\u001b[1;32m  ✓ gui_screenshot → 200\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;36m  → 5. The refusals are the contract.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[1;33m  ! gui_click (button='middle-ish') → 422 invalid button: must be left, middle, or right\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[1;33m  ! gui/attach (unregistered target) → 404 target not found\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[1;32m  ✓ POST /api/graphical-targets (protocol=rfb) → 201\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[1;33m  ! gui/attach (protocol=rfb, target=gt-600330ba993c) → 501 graphical protocol not supported: rfb\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[1;32m  ✓ POST /worker/provide-shell/hijack/78768aa4-7a57-4fc2-9c06-acaa2a5066d0/release → 200\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[1;33m  ! gui_click after release → 404 Invalid or expired hijack session.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[1;32m  ✓ every tool answered; the memory framebuffer behind them is a stub until RFB lands\u001b[0m\r\n"]
